USAGE:
  scw workflows run <command>

AVAILABLE COMMANDS:
  delete      Delete an existing workflow run by its unique identifier
  get         Get a workflow run by its unique identifier
  list        List all your workflow runs with filters
  pause       Pause a workflow run using its unique identifier
  resume      Resume a workflow run using its unique identifier
  terminate   Terminate a workflow run using its unique identifier

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for run
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta             Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers       Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use

Use "scw workflows run [command] --help" for more information about a command.
